Package: slurp
Version: @DEB_SLURP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/emersion/slurp
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libcairo2
Description: Select a region in a Wayland compositor
 slurp lets you drag out a rectangle and prints its geometry; paired with grim
 it is the standard "screenshot a region" tool. It draws the selection overlay
 with cairo into wl_shm buffers and maps itself as a zwlr_layer_surface_v1, so
 it needs the compositor's wlr-layer-shell and xdg-output support. Runs as a
 native Wayland client under the iosc compositor.
